{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e18-scene-06",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "重感情的人无法挽回  (No Turning Back Once the Heart Decides)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Still on the patio, Xingzi tells Bu Xiaogu how Chun Yuqiao once walked away empty-handed from ME at the height of his fame after his painful split with Luo Lin. Listen to their Mandarin exchange first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大在艾米的时候，我跟凯文就跟着他了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大在那儿做了一系列领导风潮的节目，也是在那儿成的名。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "后来他们经历了很难堪的感情变故，老大选择裸辞。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "除了漫长的感情创伤之外，他什么都没有从艾米带走。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "他这个人对待工作理性至极，可是对人却是感情用事的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这样的感情选择一旦做出了，就无法挽回。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "他已经决定离开星天，我们劝不回来的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不对啊，淳于总离职这么大的事，公司内部怎么没有发公告呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "无所谓吧，反正我和凯文已经辞职了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你们两个也要走吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我们是追随淳于乔来到星天的，现在他都不在了，我们留下干吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "实话实说，我是从大默默的读书会逃出来的，我回去继续当粉丝了。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大在艾米的时候，我跟凯文就跟着他了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Kaiwen and I have followed the boss ever since his days at ME.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大在那儿做了一系列领导风潮的节目，也是在那儿成的名。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He created a string of trendsetting shows there and made his name there too.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "后来他们经历了很难堪的感情变故，老大选择裸辞。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Later they went through an agonizing personal upheaval, and the boss chose to resign without a backup plan.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "除了漫长的感情创伤之外，他什么都没有从艾米带走。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Aside from lasting emotional wounds, he took nothing at all away from ME.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "他这个人对待工作理性至极，可是对人却是感情用事的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He is utterly rational toward work, yet governed by emotion when it comes to people.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这样的感情选择一旦做出了，就无法挽回。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Once an emotional choice like that is made, there is no turning back.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "他已经决定离开星天，我们劝不回来的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He has already decided to leave Xingtian, and we cannot persuade him to come back.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不对啊，淳于总离职这么大的事，公司内部怎么没有发公告呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wait, Mr Chun Yuqiao resigning is huge news, so why has the company issued no internal bulletin?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "无所谓吧，反正我和凯文已经辞职了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It makes no difference, since Kaiwen and I have already resigned.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你们两个也要走吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are the two of you leaving as well?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我们是追随淳于乔来到星天的，现在他都不在了，我们留下干吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We came to Xingtian to follow Chun Yuqiao; now that he is gone, why would we stay?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "实话实说，我是从大默默的读书会逃出来的，我回去继续当粉丝了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Truth be told, I slipped out of Wen Simo's book club, so I am heading back to be a fan.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大在艾米的时候，我跟凯文就跟着他了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大在那儿做了一系列领导风潮的节目，也是在那儿成的名。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "后来他们经历了很难堪的感情变故，老大选择裸辞。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "除了漫长的感情创伤之外，他什么都没有从艾米带走。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "他这个人对待工作理性至极，可是对人却是感情用事的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这样的感情选择一旦做出了，就无法挽回。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "他已经决定离开星天，我们劝不回来的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不对啊，淳于总离职这么大的事，公司内部怎么没有发公告呢？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "无所谓吧，反正我和凯文已经辞职了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你们两个也要走吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我们是追随淳于乔来到星天的，现在他都不在了，我们留下干吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "实话实说，我是从大默默的读书会逃出来的，我回去继续当粉丝了。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Pointing out that Xingtian has issued no internal notice of Chun Yuqiao's departure, Xiaogu spots something unusual even as Xingzi announces that she and Kaiwen have resigned too. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "再见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
